The package abandons the grammar silently (no subsumes, no sandbox gates, no metric registry, inline fallback that admits any Python function name)

"af.cli absent → stub run that still records" is the cardinal sin

The demo output "$50 vs $45" is fabricated

Let me solve all three. Real reconciliation, no theatre. One package. Enterprise-ready.

