CI — tests, registry collection, container publish, hourly refresh. Non-blocking lint.

Reconciliation — 6 checks (freshness, shed/registry drift, unknown sources, secret leaks, dead-letter backlog, stuck orders). Runs every 5 minutes. Alerts on drift. Usable in CI as --once.

