Here is the exact code to fix the issue in useEstateVoice.ts and ensure it passes the assertion.

1. Update useEstateVoice.ts
Modify the micRefusalDetail() function (and any fallback strings in micBlocker()) to be user-agent aware. The function needs to return a device-appropriate message.

